WEBVTT

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.250
The central area of the capital, Tokyo,

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:07.450
and all surrounding areas have begun
evacuating civilians.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:10.080
According to Mondenkind
Japan's announcement,

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:12.540
the area around the capital
is in danger of a Drop falling there.

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:15.250
It would appear that they used
the threat of rising ocean waters

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:17.750
as their excuse for the evacuation
in the announcement.

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:17.910
Haruka Amami

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:22.950
I am amazed that they still refuse
to come clean after all of this.

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:25.830
What was Mondenkind
Headquarter's response?

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:28.540
They are still keeping silent.

00:00:28.790 --> 00:00:32.830
Well, I suppose there is no way
they would simply hand the iDOLs over.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:35.700
Prepare to carry out a sortie,
just as we had planned.

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:39.950
Our target is Tokyo-
the iDOL Team's headquarters.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:59.450
Underneath this sky, I have always

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.870
Continued to search for my dream

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:05.410
All alone...

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:11.080
Where does everyone go forth for their journey?

00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:16.620
The days in my memories grow distant

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:21.330
Your smile from back then supports my heart now

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:28.120
Your smile from back then supports my heart now

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:38.410
I'm sure that with our silent profiles, both you and I

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:42.000
Understood that these personas exist

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.580
Because of our injuries

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:49.250
We say we do this for happiness or for love

00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:53.660
As we repeat this cruel battle

00:01:53.660 --> 00:01:57.330
Yet even so, the tears won't stop

00:01:57.660 --> 00:02:01.700
Our hopeful hearts are one

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:08.500
Our own futures are calling to us

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:16.160
Live
Panic in the
Capital
Special News Program
THE VANISHING CAPITAL
FEAR OVER A DROP!

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:16.290
Dude...

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:18.830
So who was this friend?

00:02:19.290 --> 00:02:23.620
I couldn't say... She didn't give me a name.

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:28.540
She said that the friend lives nearby,
so she'll seek shelter there.

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:35.540
Live
Panic in the
Capital
Special News Program
THE VANISHING CAPITAL
FEAR OVER A DROP!

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:31.330
As you can see,

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:34.250
Tokyo's turned into a total ghost town.

00:02:34.370 --> 00:02:36.120
There isn't a single soul in sight.

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:39.120
Special News Program
THE VANISHING CAPITAL
FEAR OVER A DROP!

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:42.080
Next, Reporter Okata at Special Provisions HQ
will give us details on how the nations of the-

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:47.910
So Aulyn actually functions
as a replacement for the Moon.

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:52.080
Certainly solves the 100-year mystery as to

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:56.250
why Earth's axis didn't shift
after Lost Artemis, huh?

00:02:56.250 --> 00:03:00.080
Right. So as the Vice Director said,

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:04.080
if the five iDOLs influence it in
any way when they are together...

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:08.870
It is highly likely that it could send
Earth down the path of ruin.

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:12.750
Why did the Vice Director keep
something so important from us?

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:15.750
Doesn't that mean he's connected
with the higher-ups?

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.080
Rumor has it that after
we gave him the boot,

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:22.450
he was able to go right back to
Headquarters without making waves.

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:26.000
At any rate, after taking
these facts into account,

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:30.290
I believe it is too risky to deploy
Nebula and Tempestas anymore.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:33.870
Hold it!

00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:37.000
The ground crew, Ribbon and
the others are currently working hard

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:40.200
to see if they can use
Nebula and Tempestas

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:42.910
to stop Imber and the others, so...

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:48.660
But if those two fall into Turiavita's hands,
it will spell the end of the world!

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:51.870
But even so, it's not like
we can really protect them.

00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:55.000
They've already issued a warning
that they're going to attack us.

00:03:55.410 --> 00:04:00.950
Sir, I will double-check to see if
we can seal them in imaginary space.

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:01.790
We can't!

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:04.660
Are you saying we should copy what
the Vice Director was trying to do?

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:06.910
We cannot sacrifice Earth!

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:15.410
Could you work on both
operations in parallel?

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:16.540
Sir!

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:22.000
I am terribly sorry,
but I am personally at a loss.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:24.410
What would be for the best...?

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.790
Please, Tempestas.

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:39.330
Please tell us what to do.

00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:48.500
What I can do...

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:05.120
We have finished evacuating the area.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:08.040
I am having the government
regulate the press.

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:10.750
How is the chick doing?

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:12.750
There is no need for concern.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.450
And what about that bastard?

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:20.120
It is also proceeding smoothly.
Everything is going according to plan.

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:24.200
This looks most unseemly.

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:27.870
It is the smallest size
we could make the collapser

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:30.540
since it possesses power equivalent
to a tactical nuclear weapon.

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:32.080
I see.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:35.500
In that case, I will look forward
to seeing it in action.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:36.620
Sir.

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:44.120
It would appear that she has been
given a motivation boost as well.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:01.160
Thank you.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:03.160
Chihaya!

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:08.330
Look at these flowers.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:12.540
I picked them out. Aren't they pretty?

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:16.290
They're pure, just like him!

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:18.790
Chihaya...?

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:23.330
The time has finally come! Finally!

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:32.080
In 30 seconds, we will commence
the launch sequence for Nubilum.

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:34.830
Commencing the launch
sequence for Hiems.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.660
Masters, please proceed to your cockpits
in all due haste.

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:50.330
Imber, let's go.

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:55.120
We shall head towards
an eternity where we are together.

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:07.620
Nazuna, go right!

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:10.620
Point 2.88 is off. What's the big deal?

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:13.370
I'm sorry! He needs more maintenance!

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:17.620
Hurry it up! Do you want me
to control his feedback from here?

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.120
Please do!

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:21.120
Sorry.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:22.410
Why are you apologizing?

00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:27.000
Isn't this only natural?
I AM Nebula's Idolmaster!

00:07:29.910 --> 00:07:31.000
Director!

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:34.540
Miss Amami, what is the matter?

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:38.790
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:39.540
A favor?

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:44.370
Let Tempestas and I...

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:49.870
Please let Tempestas and I go see Imber!

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:51.370
Wha-?!

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:56.000
Tempestas told me what to do.

00:07:57.450 --> 00:08:00.500
There is something that I must tell Imber.

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:05.290
I must... So, please!

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:14.250
Aren't you afraid?

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:18.000
Afraid? Of what?

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:28.290
When was it that I spoke with you here last,

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:31.790
Idolmaster?

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:35.790
Sir...

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:43.080
We are picking up gravitational signals
within our field's coverage.

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:45.410
It's Prometheus 1, Imber,

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:47.250
Prometheus 3, Nubilum,

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:49.040
and Prometheus 5, Hiems.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:53.660
GAD: Contact! They will enter range
of our air defenses momentarily.

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:55.580
Sir, your orders!

00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:57.950
Sir!

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:02.790
Everyone, please prepare
for an iDOL assault.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:06.000
Declare that all areas are in Code-253.

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:08.160
In preparation, close all partition doors.

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:12.660
All personnel are to follow code measures
and take their assigned positions.

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:10.250
Off Limits

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:10.830
Off Limits
Off Limits

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:11.700
Off Limits
Off Limits
Off Limits

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:15.200
The Defense Level is now at Level 4.

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:19.750
The ground crew is to continue
their operations at full capacity.

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:23.910
Once preparations are complete,
we will deploy Nebula and Tempestas.

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:25.330
Are you serious?

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:26.410
Sir!

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.250
I have been here for thirty years.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:36.700
I may have dedicated my life to my desire
to learn what precisely the iDOLs are.

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:41.950
I am terribly sorry.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.000
Sir...

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:47.410
Jeez...

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:51.660
Sorewa, Naraba, confirm the situation.

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:52.750
Miss?

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:54.540
Naze?

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:58.000
But I won't write any more apology letters.

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:00.290
I don't want to, either!

00:10:00.290 --> 00:10:03.500
I'll pass on that. Sir, that will be your job!

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:06.830
Very well.

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:17.160
Be sure to back me up, you two.

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:19.200
Most certainly.

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:24.620
Hagiwara, there is something
I want to confirm.

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:28.540
What will you do if Amami shows up?

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:33.750
I will kill her. It's for Chihaya.

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:42.620
Imber...

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:48.500
Let's destroy everything that hurts you.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:51.160
And then... feel me.

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:08.750
Prometheus 1 is directly
above Shinjuku Station.

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:10.160
Here they come!

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:25.290
I feel hot, Imber.

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:33.120
Like I could just melt.

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:42.620
Prometheus 1 has begun his descent!

00:11:42.910 --> 00:11:44.950
The spatial distortion ratio
is increasing rapidly.

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:47.410
I've verified that it has hit
Nonlinear Phenomenon, Mode 2.

00:11:47.410 --> 00:11:50.950
The spatial erosion caused by the
Minkowski limit has reached -0.3!

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:38.750
Everything within a 3km radius around
Shinjuku Station has been destroyed.

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:41.910
We've lost channels 4, 6 and 10!

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:45.160
The Yotsuya, Harajuku and Hatagaya
routes have been destroyed!

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:47.160
The route to Shibuya has been
rendered inoperable.

00:12:47.410 --> 00:12:48.410
Hurry with the lockdown!

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:50.500
We've completely lost communications!

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:50.870
Whoa! What's going on here?

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:52.410
Whoa! What's going on here?
Even the hotline has been severed.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:56.000
Give up on everything
from Area 9 to Area 44.

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:58.040
Order all staff on standby
to evacuate to a shelter.

00:12:58.040 --> 00:12:59.620
What was that bang?
Order all staff on standby
to evacuate to a shelter.

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:03.330
Imber!

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:04.660
Miss Amami...

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:08.040
I have to go!

00:13:11.540 --> 00:13:12.370
Iori...?

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:14.540
What could you possibly do
if you went out there right now?

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:14.950
But-!

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:18.080
Sir, please let me deploy Nebula.

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:22.830
What?! Of course that's an obvious "No"!

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:25.790
Nebula still has some
intricate maintenance left.

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:29.200
Besides, Tempestas still isn't ready yet.

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:31.290
We can't carry out the operation
if he isn't out there!

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.450
It'll be too late if we sit
and twiddle our thumbs!

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:37.620
Won't it defeat the point if the base got
destroyed before we sent Tempestas out?

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:38.660
That's true, but-

00:13:38.660 --> 00:13:39.450
Idiot Ribbon!
That's true, but-

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:42.450
Don't you need to speak with Imber?

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:47.160
I'll fix it up so you can, so take your time
and come out when you're ready.

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:51.000
B-but it's three-to-one. If-

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:55.290
There's no way Nebula and I will lose.

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:57.120
Ihory...

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:00.450
I'll be out there waiting for you.

00:14:09.910 --> 00:14:11.200
Give me a status update.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:19.450
I have sealed Channel 48.

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:23.620
I finished sealing off Channel 3.

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:26.750
I will begin sealing Channel 9 now.

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:30.000
All channels on Platform 10
have been rendered inoperable.

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:32.620
Kanda and Ueno have been
completely destroyed!

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:34.250
We've lost Channel 40!

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:37.500
We're cut off from all of our ocean routes!

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:40.500
They intend to sever
all of our lines of retreat.

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:44.450
But we are prepared to face
this do-or-die situation!

00:14:57.160 --> 00:14:58.790
Take this!

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:11.500
Do you find this fun?

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:15.120
Forcing an iDOL to do
something so horrible...

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:16.790
Your iDOL is crying!

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:30.500
I'm going to make that woman
regret what she did.

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:34.910
She will pay for betraying me...
for tossing me aside!

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:36.410
What the heck-Ah!

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:39.830
To see that happen, I will...

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:45.540
Do you think Iori will be okay?

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:50.080
She's fine. After all,
Nebula loves Forehead a lot!

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:54.370
That's right. We should
just focus on hurrying.

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:58.700
This will make everything go away.

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:04.080
All that will remain are the two of us,
just you and me...

00:16:05.160 --> 00:16:08.000
A world with just the two of us.

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:21.870
Why you...!

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:26.450
Are you okay with this?

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:31.200
Your beloved Nebula
is getting all beaten up.

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:33.870
I don't care.

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:39.410
I was always afraid that he would
grow to hate me if he got hurt.

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:40.410
I was afraid.

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:47.790
But I'm different now. Nebula is inside
of me. And I am inside of Nebula.

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:49.620
So I'm okay.

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:51.500
If he has to get hurt,

00:16:52.870 --> 00:16:54.790
then we'll get hurt together!

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:05.700
No way!

00:17:07.160 --> 00:17:09.750
I'm in a hurry right now!

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:16.580
What's the situation?

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:18.290
Iori?!

00:17:18.290 --> 00:17:21.910
Haruka and Tempestas are
currently heading toward No. 14.

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:23.580
They should intersect the target soon.

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:24.290
I see him!
They should intersect the target soon.

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:29.580
Everything belongs to me.

00:17:29.660 --> 00:17:31.700
Go!

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:38.540
I will not allow you to get in Chihaya's way!

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:40.700
That was nothing!

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:42.750
Chihaya!

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:49.750
Wha-?!

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:09.540
I'm not going down yet!

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:11.540
Not when she still hasn't gotten to see him!

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:17.620
What's that?

00:18:18.290 --> 00:18:19.330
It can't be!

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:23.040
I've been waiting for you,

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:24.450
Idiot Ribbon!

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:26.160
Iori!

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:28.620
Ami and Mami, please do your thing!

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:32.290
Haruka Amami!

00:18:36.870 --> 00:18:39.330
Hang in there for a sec, Nebula.

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:44.950
Imber...

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:55.750
So this was the ace up your sleeve?
Sucks to be you.

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:59.790
My voice is the only thing he can hear.

00:19:00.330 --> 00:19:02.950
He can't hear that noise!

00:19:10.830 --> 00:19:11.660
Why?!

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:18.540
Imber...

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:20.500
Can't you hear me?

00:19:21.200 --> 00:19:22.830
He plugged his ears.

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:25.330
His ears? It can't be!

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:28.410
She severed all of Imber's
Harmonics circuits,

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:30.160
and cut him off from all outside sound.

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:32.620
Keep your filthy hands off of him!

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:38.410
Make Tempestas enter his introvert mode!

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:40.500
At this rate, Iori is going to-!

00:19:42.750 --> 00:19:45.120
How horrible... Imber...

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:01.910
Haruka?!

00:20:04.620 --> 00:20:06.830
Imber, I...

00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:10.250
I will not let things end here.

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:16.580
I finally, finally figured it out.

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:21.000
I know what I wanted to do.

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:25.200
I know why I am here.

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:28.450
At long last...

00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:33.000
I-!

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:34.540
Stay back!

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:51.950
You are the one...

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:54.370
I love you!

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:29.000
Nagaku, nagaku tsumugimashou
Let's intertwine ourselves for a long, long time

00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:38.250
Keshite futari ga hodokenu you
So that the two of us are never unraveled

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:33.660
Are you all right, Chihaya?

00:21:33.660 --> 00:21:34.540
Chihaya!

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:47.200
Yagate kuchita karada wo nugi
And someday I will shed my withered body

00:21:40.080 --> 00:21:41.750
We're pulling back.

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:45.660
Did she save us?

00:21:45.910 --> 00:21:47.160
Looks like it.

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:55.580
Nee, hitotsu ni naru made terashi tsuzukeru
Say, continue to shine until we become one

00:21:47.500 --> 00:21:51.160
Indeed. We managed
to pull through this time.

00:21:57.160 --> 00:22:06.790
Dear boy, itsuka anata ga mezashita sekai wa
Dear boy, may the world you sought someday

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:01.790
Imber...

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:16.080
Mou kanashimi ga kieta mirai de arimasu you ni
Hold a future where there is no more sadness

00:22:08.330 --> 00:22:11.700
I've always loved you.

00:22:16.080 --> 00:22:24.950
Inori wa watashi ni yorokobi wo kureta
That prayer has given me such happiness

00:22:24.950 --> 00:22:36.540
Mada todokanai keredo truth wo shinjitete
It hasn't reached you yet, but believe in the truth

00:22:51.950 --> 00:23:00.950
Mabataku kidou wa futari no mejirushi
That sparkling trail will be the guide for us both

00:23:00.950 --> 00:23:12.500
Ima doko de mite iru no? Truth kanjiteru
Now, where are you looking? I feel the truth

00:23:25.910 --> 00:23:40.910
Preview
108 Years of Reconstruction

00:23:26.950 --> 00:23:31.080
Man, my eyes are sore! Why must
our Command Room be so dark?

00:23:31.080 --> 00:23:32.410
I can't see a thing!

00:23:32.410 --> 00:23:35.120
I got a pair of these just for you!

00:23:35.290 --> 00:23:37.830
I can see really good with these glasses!

00:23:37.830 --> 00:23:39.160
They're granny glasses.
